doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22165418
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-29"
keywords:
  - propensity score matching
  - causal inference
  - nested case-control
  - incidence-density sampling
  - epidemiology
  - scikit-learn
abstract: >-
  Statistical matching for cohort studies: nearest-neighbor and optimal
  matching on propensity scores or covariate distances, propensity
  subclassification, coarsened exact matching, and risk-set matching, with
  calipers, exact constraints, balance diagnostics, and treatment-effect
  estimation. Validated against R's MatchIt; scales to biobank-sized cohorts.
